IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTDECODE-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 BATCH-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 WARPS-PER-SM        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TENSOR-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TOTAL-WARPS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTDECODE-V2.
    IF BATCH-SIZE == 0 OR WARPS-PER-SM == 0 OR TENSOR-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE BATCH-SIZE TO TOTAL-WARPS.
    MULTIPLY WARPS-PER-SM BY TOTAL-WARPS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-WARPS.
    WEIGHT 30 BATCH-SIZE.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
